{"t":"Shattered Isles","s":"shattered-isles-56e76","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The Shattered Isles are a group of islands west of the island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darama\">Darama</a>, and south of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">Mainland</a>. Some centuries ago, the isles belonged to a single landmass, from which strong magic flowed. Then, dark powers from the depth of the seas attacked the peaceful land dwellers, for the control of this magic. The war shattered the isles and destroyed both civilizations, and turned the magic of the isles into chaos.\n</p>\n<table class=\"basic-table\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Vandura\">Vandura</a>  (<a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>)</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Nargor\">Nargor</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Treasure%20Island\">Treasure Island</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Forbidden%20Islands\">Forbidden Islands</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Laguna%20Islands\">Laguna Islands</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 179px; height: 179px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1725px;left:-454px;clip:rect(1725px 633px 1904px 454px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"2560\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br